<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donohue started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donohue started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst James MacGregor has started coverage of Canadian forest products company Donohue Inc with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- MacGregor was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
